t-chip px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full transition-colors" style="background:transparent;color:currentColor;opacity:0.7">Dark</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" title="Light theme" class="nlt-chip px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full transition-colors" style="background:transparent;color:currentColor;opacity:0.7">Light</button></div></div><a class="inline-flex items-center font-bold px-5 py-2 rounded-lg text-white text-sm whitespace-nowrap" style="background-color:#1a6fc4" href="/contact">Contact</a></div><button class="xl:hidden p-2 rounded-lg" style="color:var(--text-primary)" aria-label="Toggle menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobile-menu"><span class="text-xl" aria-hidden="true">☰</span></button></div></div><nav aria-label="Crawlable" class="sr-only"><span><a href="/about">About</a><a href="/about">About NLT</a><a href="/past-performance">Past Performance</a><a href="/careers">Careers</a></span><span><a href="/services">Services</a><a href="/services/data-science-ai">Data Science &amp; AI</a><a href="/services/geospatial-remote-sensing">Geospatial &amp; Remote Sensing</a><a href="/services/cloud-managed-services">Cloud &amp; Managed Services</a><a href="/services/cloud-hosting">Cloud Hosting</a><a href="/services/cybersecurity">Cybersecurity</a><a href="/services/software-engineering">Software &amp; Systems Engineering</a><a aria-label="Emergency Management services" href="/services/emergency-management">Emergency Management</a><a href="/services/analytics-insights">Analytics &amp; Insights</a><a href="/services/research">Research &amp; Analytics</a><a href="/services/workforce-staffing">Workforce &amp; Staffing</a></span><span><a href="/industries">Industries</a><a href="/industries/state-local">State &amp; Local</a><a href="/industries/federal">Federal Government</a><a aria-label="Emergency Management industry" href="/industries/emergency-management">Emergency Management</a><a href="/industries/utilities">Utilities &amp; Telecom</a><a href="/industries/international-development">International Development</a><a href="/industries/health">Health &amp; Human Services</a><a href="/industries/smart-cities">Smart Cities &amp; Engineering</a><a href="/industries/associations-non-profits">Associations &amp; Non-Profits</a><a href="/industries/commercial-enterprise">Commercial &amp; Enterprise</a><a href="/industries/global-development-health">Global Development &amp; Health</a></span><span><a href="/clients">Clients</a><a href="/clients">Clients</a><a href="/client-stories">Client Stories</a></span><span><a href="/partners">Partners</a></span><span><a href="/blog">News &amp; Blog</a><a href="/blog">NLT Blog</a><a href="/publications">Publications</a><a href="/presentations">Presentations</a><a href="/resources">Resources</a></span></nav></header><div id="main-content"><main><section class="relative overflow-hidden" style="background:radial-gradient(900px 460px at 84% 10%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-cyan) 14%, transparent) 0%, transparent 60%), linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-secondary), var(--bg-primary));padding:54px 0 30px"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_.95fr] gap-8 lg:gap-11 items-center"><div><span class="v5-eyebrow">Science · Technology · Mission</span><h1 class="text-[clamp(34px,5vw,60px)] font-black leading-[1.02] my-3.5" style="letter-spacing:-0.035em;color:var(--text-heading)">Integrated Ingenuity</h1><p class="text-[17.5px] max-w-[46ch] mb-6" style="color:var(--text-secondary)">We provide integrated consulting, research, and technology services with the agility and ingenuity today’s missions demand — geospatial, data science and AI/ML, cloud, cybersecurity, software engineering, and workforce — for public, private, and non-profit customers.</p><div class="flex gap-3 flex-wrap"><a class="v5-btn v5-btn-primary" href="/contact">Book a discovery call</a></div><p class="mt-5 text-[13px]" style="color:var(--text-muted)">Founded 2001 in Washington, DC. An extension of your team for twenty-five years.</p></div><div class="min-w-0 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border" style="border-color:var(--border-color);aspect-ratio:16 / 9;min-height:280px"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="1280" height="720" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="/video/nlt-home-poster.jpg"/><video class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover motion-reduce:hidden" src="/video/nlt-home.mp4" poster="/video/nlt-home-poster.jpg" autoPlay="" muted="" loop="" playsInline="" preload="metadata" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></video><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(10,31,68,0.62) 0%, rgba(10,31,68,0.28) 55%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-cyan) 30%, rgba(10,31,68,0.22)) 100%)"></div><nav aria-label="Integrated service lines" class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-5 sm:p-6"><div class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] mb-2.5" style="color:#a9c9e0">Integrated service lines</div><ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 list-none m-0 p-0"><li><a class="inline-flex items-center text-[12.5px] font-semibold rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 border transition-colors hover:bg-white/20 focus-visible:bg-white/20" style="color:#eaf4fb;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.28);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.10);backdrop-filter:blur(4px)" href="/services/geospatial-remote-sensing">Geospatial<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-1">→</span></a></li><li><a class="inline-flex items-center text-[12.5px] font-semibold rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 border transition-colors hover:bg-white/20 focus-visible:bg-white/20" style="color:#eaf4fb;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.28);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.10);backdrop-filter:blur(4px)" href="/services/data-science-ai">Data science &amp; AI/ML<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-1">→</span></a></li><li><a class="inline-flex items-center text-[12.5px] font-semibold rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 border transition-colors hover:bg-white/20 focus-visible:bg-white/20" style="color:#eaf4fb;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.28);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.10);backdrop-filter:blur(4px)" href="/services/cloud-managed-services">Cloud<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-1">→</span></a></li><li><a class="inline-flex items-center text-[12.5px] font-semibold rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 border transition-colors hover:bg-white/20 focus-visible:bg-white/20" style="color:#eaf4fb;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.28);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.10);backdrop-filter:blur(4px)" href="/services/cybersecurity">Cybersecurity<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-1">→</span></a></li><li><a class="inline-flex items-center text-[12.5px] font-semibold rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 border transition-colors hover:bg-white/20 focus-visible:bg-white/20" style="color:#eaf4fb;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.28);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.10);backdrop-filter:blur(4px)" href="/services/software-engineering">Software engineering<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-1">→</span></a></li><li><a class="inline-flex items-center text-[12.5px] font-semibold rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 border transition-colors hover:bg-white/20 focus-visible:bg-white/20" style="color:#eaf4fb;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.28);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.10);backdrop-filter:blur(4px)" href="/services/workforce-staffing">Workforce<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-1">→</span></a></li></ul></nav></div></div></section><section class="py-8 pb-11" style="background:var(--bg-primary)"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_1fr_1fr] gap-[18px]"><div class="v5-card flex flex-col"><div class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 border-b" style="border-color:var(--border-color)"><span class="text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]" style="color:var(--accent-blue-hover)">Insights</span><a class="text-xs font-semibold nlt-hover-link" style="color:var(--text-muted)" href="/blog">All insights →</a></div><div class="p-4 flex flex-col gap-3 flex-1"><a class="block h-[132px] rounded-[10px] relative overflow-hidden nlt-hover-link" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-blue) 0%, var(--accent-cyan) 60%, var(--accent-gold) 130%)" href="/blog/master-address-repository-foundation-for-digital-government"><img src="/blog/master-address-repository-foundation-for-digital-government.svg" alt="The Master Address Repository: Foundation for Digital Government Service Delivery" width="800" height="264" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" loading="eager" decoding="async"/></a><div class="text-[10.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em]" style="color:var(--accent-blue-hover)">Government Technology</div><h3 class="text-[17px] font-extrabold leading-snug" style="color:var(--text-primary)"><a class="nlt-hover-link" href="/blog/master-address-repository-foundation-for-digital-government">The Master Address Repository: Foundation for Digital Government Service Delivery</a></h3><p class="text-[13px] leading-snug" style="color:var(--text-secondary)">Every permit, emergency call, utility connection, and constituent service begins with an address. When that address data is fragmented across disconnected systems, service delivery suffers. A Master Address Repository provides the authoritative foundation that makes digital government work.</p><div class="flex gap-2 flex-wrap mt-0.5"><span class="text-[11.5px] border rounded-full px-[11px] py-[5px]" style="color:var(--text-muted);border-color:var(--border-color);background:var(--panel-2)"><b class="font-extrabold" style="color:var(--text-primary)">25</b> yrs at data scale</span><span class="text-[11.5px] border rounded-full px-[11px] py-[5px]" style="color:var(--text-muted);border-color:var(--border-color);background:var(--panel-2)">Census → World Bank</span></div><div class="mt-auto text-xs" style="color:var(--text-muted)">July 26, 2026<!-- --> · <a class="font-semibold" style="color:var(--accent-blue)" href="/blog/master-address-repository-foundation-for-digital-government">Read →</a></div></div></div><div class="v5-card flex flex-col"><div class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 border-b" style="border-color:var(--border-color)"><span class="text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]" style="color:var(--accent-blue-hover)">In their words</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px]" style="color:var(--text-muted)"><span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 rounded-full" style="background:var(--accent-cyan);box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--accent-cyan)" aria-hidden="true"></span>8<!-- --> voices</span></div><div class="p-4 flex flex-col gap-3 flex-1" data-quote-index="0"><span class="self-start text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] px-[9px] py-[3px] rounded-full border" style="color:var(--accent-blue-hover);border-color:var(--border-color)">Federal</span><span class="text-[38px] leading-none h-3.5 font-black" style="color:var(--accent-blue)" aria-hidden="true">“</span><p class="text-[15px] leading-normal" style="color:var(--text-primary)" aria-live="polite">In my 34 years in both the private and government sectors, I&#x27;ve never worked with a better team. They are responsive, knowledgeable, quality-driven, mission-driven, hard-working, professional, and they manage to do it all in a manner that instills confidence.</p><div class="mt-auto flex items-center gap-3 flex-wrap text-xs" style="color:var(--text-muted)"><span>— <!-- -->Senior program leadership · Federal agency</span><div class="ml-auto flex items-center gap-2"><div class="flex gap-1.5 flex-wrap" role="tablist" aria-label="Testimonial slides"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-label="Show testimonial 1 of 8" class="h-[7px] rounded-full transition-all" style="width:18px;background:var(--accent-blue)"></button><button type="b