hrough operations.</p><div class="flex gap-3 justify-center flex-wrap"><a class="v5-btn v5-btn-primary" href="/contact">Book a discovery call</a><a class="v5-btn v5-btn-ghost" style="border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.28);color:#eaf4fb" href="/capabilities-statement">Get our capabilities statement</a></div></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></div><footer class="section-canvas border-t border-theme"><div class="py-12 border-b border-theme"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center"><div><p class="text-lg font-bold mb-2 text-theme-heading">Making the world safer, healthier, more prosperous, and efficient through science and technology.</p><p class="text-sm text-theme-muted">Founded 2001 — twenty-five years of mission delivery. Integrated consulting, research, and technology services for public, private, and non-profit customers. Work across many countries. One integrated team.</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 lg:justify-end"><a class="inline-flex items-center font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg text-white text-sm" style="background-color:#1a6fc4" href="/contact">Contact us →</a><a class="inline-flex items-center font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg text-sm border border-theme text-theme-heading nlt-hover-link" href="/capabilities-statement">Build a capabilities statement →</a></div></div></div></div><div class="py-14 border-b border-theme"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-8"><div class="col-span-2 md:col-span-3 lg:col-span-2"><a aria-label="New Light Technologies" class="inline-flex items-center hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity" href="/"><span class="nlt-brand-logo inline-flex items-center"><img alt="New Light Technologies" width="210" height="40" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="nlt-brand-logo__light h-9 w-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/nlt-logo.png"/><img alt="New Light Technologies" width="140" height="40" dec