foundation-for-digital-government.svg\",\"alt\":\"The Master Address Repository: Foundation for Digital Government Service Delivery\",\"width\":800,\"height\":264,\"className\":\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover\",\"loading\":\"eager\",\"decoding\":\"async\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[10.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em]\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--accent-blue-hover)\"},\"children\":\"Government Technology\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[17px] font-extrabold leading-snug\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--text-primary)\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L14\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog/master-address-repository-foundation-for-digital-government\",\"className\":\"nlt-hover-link\",\"children\":\"The Master Address Repository: Foundation for Digital Government Service Delivery\"}]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[13px] leading-snug\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--text-secondary)\"},\"children\":\"Every permit, emergency call, utility connection, and constituent service begins with an address. When that address data is fragmented across disconnected systems, service delivery suffers. A Master Address Repository provides the authoritative foundation that makes digital government work.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-2 flex-wrap mt-0.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11.5px] border rounded-full px-[11px] py-[5px]\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--text-muted)\",\"borderColor\":\"var(--border-color)\",\"background\":\"var(--panel-2)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"b\",null,{\"cl"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"assName\":\"font-extrabold\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--text-primary)\"},\"children\":\"25\"}],\" yrs at data scale\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11.5px] border rounded-full px-[11px] py-[5px]\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--text-muted)\",\"borderColor\":\"var(--border-color)\",\"background\":\"var(--panel-2)\"},\"children\":\"Census → World Bank\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-auto text-xs\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--text-muted)\"},\"children\":[\"July 26, 2026\",\" · \",[\"$\",\"$L14\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog/master-address-repository-foundation-for-digital-government\",\"className\":\"font-semibold\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--accent-blue)\"},\"children\":\"Read →\"}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"v5-card flex flex-col\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 border-b\",\"style\":{\"borderColor\":\"var(--border-color)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--accent-blue-hover)\"},\"children\":\"In their words\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px]\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"var(--text-muted)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-block w-2 h-2 rounded-full\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"var(--accent-cyan)\",\"boxShadow\":\"0 0 8px var(--accent-cyan)\"},\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],8,\" voices\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L37\",null,{\"quotes\":[{\"badge\":\"Federal\",\"quote\":\"In my 34 years in both the private and government sectors, I've never worked with a better team. They are responsive, knowledgeable, quality-driven, mission-driven, hard-working, professional, and they manage to do it all in a manner that instills confidence.\",\"attribution\":\"Senior program leadership · Federal agency\"},{\"badge\":\"State \u0026 Local\",\"quote\":\"They were a pivotal partner in our landmark BTOP execution, navigating the complex GIS planning to deploy hundreds of miles of fiber across Washington, DC — connecting government services and bridging the digital divide for underserved communities.\",\"attribution\":\"Former CIO, metropolitan public-safety agency · longtime DC client\"},{\"badge\":\"Federal\",\"quote\":\"Even when fully engaged on a project, they always ensure their own people get the credit and the spotlight. It's clear they care deeply about their team and their clients' success.\",\"attribution\":\"Former Geographic Information Officer · Federal agency client\"},{\"badge\":\"Culture\",\"quote\":\"NLT'ers are smart, caring, collegial, and passionate about the customers they support. I've worked at places large and small — NLT's culture is the pinnacle of my experience.\",\"attribution\":\"Cloud architect · former NLT engineer\"},{\"badge\":\"State \u0026 Local\",\"quote\":\"They distinguish themselves by forming durable, innovative, reliable partnerships with customers like me. I recommend them unhesitatingly and enthusiastically.\",\"attribution\":\"CIO, District of Columbia agency · longtime client\"},{\"badge\":\"State \u0026 Local\",\"quote\":\"They delivered the identification, capture, and integration of student data from a wide range of institutions into a DC government data warehouse. The results were highly successful and set the framework for future data collection.\",\"attribution\":\"Senior IT Manager · DC government education agency\"},{\"badge\":\"Partner\",\"quote\":\"I've worked with NLT for over ten years. They work very hard to ensure their customers and partners receive a high-quality engagement, every time.\",\"attribution\":\"Sales executive, geospatial software partner · longtime partner\"},{\"badge\":\"Health/Commercial\",\"quote\":\"I've worked with New Light as both a customer and a subcontractor. I know their geospatial work, but they've been a great partner in enterprise architecture and healthcare IT as well.\",\"attribution\":\"CEO, health-IT firm · client and teaming partner\"}]}]]}],\"$L38\"]}]}]}]\n33:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"py-5\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"var(--panel-2)\",\"borderTop\":\"1px solid var(--border-color)\",\"borderBottom\":\"1px solid var(--border-color)\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex gap-3 flex-wrap 